01:10:48.682 --> 01:10:56.948
[SPEAKER_00]: exhilarating at the same time. But I think on that note, Andreas, we have pretty much covered everything that we planned for, except for the last

01:10:57.068 --> 01:11:05.915
[SPEAKER_00]: and the most beautiful part of the show. That is, if you can share with our audiences one magical moment that has stuck with you from all these

01:11:05.955 --> 01:11:16.202
