01:11:26.189 --> 01:11:36.889
[SPEAKER_01]: would mention here is in Norway, the line being stagnant. I mentioned it a little earlier. We, this is a very beautiful mountain near the Lofoten

01:11:37.270 --> 01:11:49.253
