01:11:49.293 --> 01:12:02.028
[SPEAKER_01]: little snow field, so it was really easy to take off, but it's a takeoff over a cliff. We took off there in midnight sun and I think it was June. The

01:12:02.068 --> 01:12:10.714
[SPEAKER_01]: story behind it was when we first visited Nepal and climbed Amadablam, we were looking about some mountains, some ideas. And when you look up

01:12:10.834 --> 01:12:18.919
