01:12:18.939 --> 01:12:31.226
[SPEAKER_01]: these lists, we found the Statent in Norway as well. So we had this image in our head and also printed out on our toilet. It was on the wall. Since

01:12:32.086 --> 01:12:41.610
[SPEAKER_01]: 2015. Always as a little dream in our heads. When we finally took the time to visit Norway, we traveled in Norway for three months. Then we said,

01:12:41.710 --> 01:12:51.935
